{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11103050","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11103050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1110305001:1":{"text":"소렌, 넌 이미 네 실력을 증명했고, 블랙하울 부족은 다시 널 받아들이기로 했어.","source_cn":"索恩，现在你已经证明了自己的实力。黑嚎氏族愿意重新接纳你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x495016D51BCFCC61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110305002:2":{"text":"그래, 어서 돌아와! 너와 핏줄을 나눈 부족은 우리야. 이제 저 나약한 놈들과 섞이지 마.","source_cn":"是啊，快回来吧！与你血脉同源的族人是我们，别跟这些弱者...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9F018CEF88C4C25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110305003:1":{"text":"내가 태어난 뒤, 날 “약자”로 낙인찍고 아기 포대기까지 벗겨서 사막에 버린 주제에...","source_cn":"出生后，把我打上“弱小”烙印的，剥去我的襁褓，将我遗弃...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x545CEF7717FBE4E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110305004:1":{"text":"이제 와서 같은 혈통의 부족이라고요?","source_cn":"“血脉同源的族人”吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A4630A2DB8BDDEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110305005:1":{"text":"사막의 밤은 얼음골이였어요. 그런 곳에 아기를 버려놓고 <style=\"stress\">자생</style>하길 바란 건가요, 아니면 <style=\"stress\">자멸</style>하길 바란 건가요?","source_cn":"沙漠的黑夜滴水成冰。你们把一个婴儿遗弃在那里，是想让他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD69A362B2AA1FEE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110305006:1":{"text":"아버지가 절 받아주신 순간부터 전 그저 우르 부족의 소렌입니다.","source_cn":"从老爹收留我的那一刻起，我就只是乌尔氏族的索恩了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD00FD40F3DE7D0D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110305007:1":{"text":"그럼 우리 블랙하울 부족은 뭐라고 생각하는 거지?","source_cn":"那你又把我们黑嚎氏族当成了什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x235948413AAB447A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110305008:1":{"text":"원수? 당신들은 그럴 자격도 없어요. 제겐 그저 낯선 사람일 뿐이죠.","source_cn":"仇人？你们还不配。你们只是陌生人而已。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x404C4F914EF40AB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110305009:1":{"text":"이런 배은망덕한 녀석! 오늘 기어코 널 데려가고야 말 테다!","source_cn":"不识好歹的东西！咱们今天抢也要把你小子抢回去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E9D17CF29DCAA96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110305010:1":{"text":"진정해, 소렌! 나도 너처럼 화가 나지만 일단 방법을 생각해야 해...","source_cn":"冷静一点，索恩！我和你一样气愤，但我们得先想办法……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15F75ABA6843DDA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110305011:1":{"text":"아르사... 네가 나보다 더 분노할 리가 없어.","source_cn":"阿尔萨……你永远不可能和我一样气愤。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E5A68ED74392C27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110305012:1":{"text":"알았어, 알았다고! 나도 저들이 널 데려가도록 가만두지 않을 거야.","source_cn":"好了好了，我知道！我绝对不会让他们把你抢走的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85F34053CF079E0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110305013:1":{"text":"오합지졸 따위가 소렌을 보호한다고? 오히려 네가 보호받길 바라는 거겠지.","source_cn":"一群乌合之众，还想保护索恩？他们反过来还要你保护，对吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x765451DCDCB656DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110305014:1":{"text":"닥쳐!","source_cn":"闭嘴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C61C6EDC8A2262E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:骄傲的黑嚎战士":{"text":"오만한 블랙하울 전사","source":"骄傲的黑嚎战士","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:强壮的黑嚎战士":{"text":"건장한 블랙하울 전사","source":"强壮的黑嚎战士","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"소렌","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"아르사","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":4}}